<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Mentory</title>
  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      background: #101010;
      color: #f5f5f5;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    header {
      height: 78px;
      background: #24211f;
      border-bottom: 3px solid #050505;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 0 42px;
    }

    .logo {
      font-size: 34px;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      color: #ffffff;
      text-shadow: 4px 4px 0 #000;
    }

    nav {
      display: flex;
      gap: 42px;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    nav a {
      color: #eeeeee;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .buy-btn {
      border: 2px solid #42a832;
      color: #59d946;
      padding: 14px 24px;
      font-weight: 800;
      text-decoration: none;
      background: transparent;
    }

    .wrap {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 58% 42%;
      gap: 24px;
      padding: 62px 42px 40px;
    }

    .main-box {
      background: #24211f;
      border: 4px solid #3a3a3a;
      padding: 20px;
    }

    .hero-img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 530px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3d6cff, #d566ff, #ffae42);
      border: 2px solid #111;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      overflow: hidden;
      position: relative;
    }

    .hero-img::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      width: 160%;
      height: 160%;
      background-image:
        linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,.15) 1px, transparent 1px),
        linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,.15) 1px, transparent 1px);
      background-size: 45px 45px;
      transform: rotate(15deg);
    }

    .hero-text {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .hero-text h1 {
      font-size: 74px;
      font-weight: 900;
      text-shadow: 5px 5px 0 #111;
    }

    .hero-text p {
      margin-top: 14px;
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: 800;
      background: #111;
      color: #ffe45e;
      padding: 8px 18px;
      display: inline-block;
    }

    .title {
      margin-top: 22px;
      font-size: 44px;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
    }

    .info {
      display: flex;
      gap: 24px;
      margin-top: 18px;
      align-items: center;
      color: #ddd;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .stars {
      color: #ffd83d;
      font-size: 22px;
    }

    .os {
      display: flex;
      gap: 28px;
      margin-top: 26px;
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .right h3 {
      font-size: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .card {
      background: #282523;
      border: 4px solid #3c3c3c;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
      padding: 22px;
      position: relative;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .card.active {
      border-color: #5eb944;
    }

    .badge {
      position: absolute;
      top: -28px;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      background: #47e4d8;
      color: #111;
      text-align: center;
      font-weight: 900;
      padding: 4px;
      border: 2px solid #81fff5;
    }

    .card h2 {
      font-size: 32px;
      font-weight: 500;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .tags {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 8px;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .tag {
      background: #151515;
      padding: 5px 8px;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .line {
      border-top: 2px solid #111;
      margin: 12px 0 16px;
    }

    .price {
      font-size: 26px;
      font-weight: 900;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .circle {
      width: 22px;
      height: 22px;
      border: 3px solid #eee;
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: inline-block;
    }

    .active .circle {
      border-color: #80e66d;
      box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 5px #222, inset 0 0 0 12px #80e66d;
    }

    .bottom-btns {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 24px;
      margin-top: 16px;
    }

    .gift, .pay {
      height: 64px;
      font-size: 22px;
      font-weight: 900;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .gift {
      background: #282523;
      color: #fff;
      border: 3px solid #ddd;
    }

    .pay {
      background: #36a523;
      color: #fff;
      border: 3px solid #55c63f;
    }

    @media (max-width: 1000px) {
      header {
        height: auto;
        padding: 20px;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 18px;
      }

      nav {
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 18px;
      }

      .wrap {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        padding: 28px 18px;
      }

      .hero-img {
        height: 320px;
      }

      .hero-text h1 {
        font-size: 46px;
      }

      .title {
        font-size: 30px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="logo">MENTORY</div>
    <nav>
      <a href="#">팀 소개</a>
      <a href="#">목차</a>
      <a href="#">아이템</a>
      <a href="#">관광투어</a>
      <a href="#">지원</a>
    </nav>
    <a class="buy-btn" href="#">지금 시작 〉</a>
  </header>

  <main class="wrap">
    <section class="main-box">
      <div class="hero-img">
        <div class="hero-text">
          <h1>MENTORY</h1>
          <p>MENTOR MATCHING PLATFORM</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h1 class="title">MENTORY: MENTOR & STORY</h1>
      <div class="info">
        <span class="stars">★★★★★</span>
        <span>(4.8) 12.4K</span>
        <span>🎓 대학생 추천</span>
      </div>
      <div class="os">
        <span>💻 온라인 멘토링</span>
        <span>🏫 오프라인 가능</span>
        <span>📱 모바일 지원</span>
      </div>
    </section>

    <aside class="right">
      <h3>멘토링 팀원 소개</h3>

      <div class="card active" onclick="pick(this)">
        <h2>팀장 : 안성현</h2>
        <div class="tags">
          <span class="tag">사이버경찰학과</span>
          <span class="tag">국제마케팅학과</span>
          <span class="tag">일본어</span>
        </div>
        <div class="line"></div>
        <div class="price"><span class="circle"></span> 자유롭게 살자</div>
      </div>

      <div class="card" onclick="pick(this)">
        <h2>추민성</h2>
        <div class="tags">
          <span class="tag">글로벌자율전공</span>
          <span class="tag">일본어학과</span>
          <span class="tag">중고 신입생</span>
        </div>
        <div class="line"></div>
        <div class="price"><span class="circle"></span> 자유롭게 살자</div>
      </div>

      <div class="card" onclick="pick(this)">
        <h2>최연주</h2>
        <div class="tags">
          <span class="tag">항공서비스학과</span>
          <span class="tag">신입생</span>
        </div>
        <div class="line"></div>
        <div class="price"><span class="circle"></span> 자유롭게 살자</div>
      </div>

      <div class="card" onclick="pick(this)">
        <h2>최유빈</h2>
        <div class="tags">
          <span class="tag">항공서비스학과</span>
          <span class="tag">신입생</span>
        </div>
        <div class="line"></div>
        <div class="price"><span class="circle"></span> 자유롭게 살자</div>
      </div>

      <div class="bottom-btns">
        <button class="gift">🎁 자퇴하기</button>
        <button class="pay">졸업하기 〉</button>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </main>

  <script>
    function pick(a) {
      var b = document.querySelectorAll('.card');
      for (var i = 0; i < b.length; i++) {
        b[i].classList.remove('active');
      }
      a.classList.add('active');
    }
  </script>
</body>
</html>
